<title>USA: EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</title>
<headline>EIA Weekly U.S. Propane Inventory Report.</headline>
<text>
<p>U.S. PROPANE STOCKS (IN MILLION BARRELS)</p>
<p>		01/24/97    01/17/97   01/26/96   12/95  Change/Wk</p>
<p>East Coast	 4.1	 4.4	2.2	 3.4     - 0.3</p>
<p>Midwest	   10.7	11.4     12.7	 17.3    - 0.7</p>
<p>Gulf Coast	18.3	20.2     15.2	 20.2    - 1.9</p>
<p>U.S. Total	34.4	37.3     31.2	 42.9    - 2.9</p>
<p>Source: Estimates by U.S. Department of Energy's Energy Information Administration. EIA will report propane stocks on a weekly basis from October to May. - Totals may not equal sum of regions due to rounding.</p>
</text>
